# Hardware Block Diagram

This diagram shows the reference ESP32 microgrid node architecture.
For design decisions and assumptions, see 'hardware/Documentation/design-decisions.md'
For detailed block descriptions, see 'hardware/Architecture/block-diagram-notes.md'



